OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStrong winds
OL,6,Fat first will gradually ease through
OL,7,Fthe evening and overnight. Scattered
OL,8,Fshowers from the west at first,
OL,9,Fbecoming dry with clear spells
OL,10,Fovernight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FDry with some brightness to
OL,13,Fstart the day. Cloud and rain spread
OL,14,Fnorth from late morning and becoming
OL,15,Frather windy through the afternoon and
OL,16,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
