OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FVery
OL,6,Fwindy with rain or showers on Tuesday.
OL,7,FBright spells and scattered showers on
OL,8,FWednesday, driest in the east. Dry
OL,9,FThursday with bright spells and
OL,10,Fvariable cloud.
